# Hutch search-ignore policy (agent context economy).
#
# Keeps generated, vendored, local-state and bulky evidence trees out of code
# search so agent sessions do not burn tokens on build output, lockfiles or
# 381 MB of evidence captures. The same rules live in .ignore, .dshignore and
# .opencodeignore so every agent tool agrees. Git tracking policy is separate:
# .gitignore decides what may be committed, and reviewed lockfiles/evidence
# stay tracked there even though search skips them here.
#
# Syntax: gitignore-style globs relative to this file. These rules never
# remove files from Git or from the working tree; they only narrow what search
# tools walk. Remember that tracked files (uv.lock, package-lock.json,
# Cargo.lock, evidence ZIPs) are still skippable in search.
#
# Honest tool coverage: .ignore is honored by ripgrep. This DSH build does not
# yet read .dshignore, and .opencodeignore support depends on the OpenCode
# version; all three files are kept identical so the convention is ready.
# See docs/agent-workflow.md and docs/repository-hygiene.md.
#
# No emoji in this file or anywhere in the repository; see scripts/audit_emoji.py.

# Installed environments and parallel worktree checkouts.
/.worktrees/
/.venv/
venv/
node_modules/

# Desktop host build output (Rust/Tauri intermediates and bundled backend).
/desktop/target/
/desktop/process-guard/target/
/desktop/binaries/
/desktop/gen/

# Python/npm build and packaging output. Root-anchored so a future source
# package such as src/hutch/build/ cannot be hidden by an unanchored build/.
/build/
/dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Test and analysis caches, coverage output.
.pytest_cache/
.hypothesis/
.validation/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
coverage/
.coverage
.coverage.*
coverage.xml
htmlcov/
playwright-report/
test-results/

# Dependency resolution trees. Read the manifests (pyproject.toml,
# package.json, Cargo.toml) and the public API instead of a lockfile dump.
uv.lock
package-lock.json
desktop/**/Cargo.lock
*.lock

# Documentation evidence trees (about 381 MB of captures and traces). Tests
# load the few needed fixtures by exact path; they are never search material.
docs/**/artifacts/**
*.zip
*.log

# Local runtime state, databases and server scratch (never search these).
.state/
*.db*
*.sqlite*
/serve.pid
/var/
/reports/

# Editor, agent and design-tool scratch state.
/.superdesign/
/.opencode/skills/
/.agents/skills/
/src/hutch/server/static/vendor/
